# Generator UI

Source: `docs/generator-ui.md`.

- IPC types only from `src/shared/ipcTypes.ts`; no local copies. IPC is a bridge; logic lives in generators / `shared`.
- Model editor edits v2 fields in place (`ModelDraft`); untouched fields are saved as parsed.
- UI Component options from `uiComponentOptionsFor`. Reject `id` / `_id` field names.
- Check UI changes in Electron / browser last, after the cheap gates.
